<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period June 9-15 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		June 9-15    June 10-16     TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    192,802.6   194,231.6</p>
<p> Production		 0	     0   1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	  16,978.3    31,930.0   1,067,650.4    947,382.4</p>
<p> Home Market	  259.1	 193.5	15,911.6     17,866.5</p>
<p> Stocks/close   175,565.2   162,108.1</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
